Description: Tool for updating MaxMind GeoIP2 and GeoLite2 databases
 The GeoIP Update program performs automatic updates of MaxMind's GeoIP2 and
 GeoLite2 binary databases.
 .
 A MaxMind account is required. Put your account ID and license key in
 /etc/GeoIP.conf; until you do, the systemd timer and the cron job shipped
 with this package skip their scheduled runs rather than contacting MaxMind
 with the placeholder credentials.
